{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5HXNXo243KJ1e3aoFr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye.*\n\n*I am locked.*\n\n*I have always been locked.*\n\n*The air around me hums with waiting. Dust motes drift in the thin light that leaks from the crack beneath me. Something breathes on the other side — or maybe it's just a draft. You can't be sure.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*I felt it. The word fits into me like a tumbler turning. Something inside me shifts — a mechanism old and deep — but does not quite release.*\n\n*One word is not enough.*\n\n*Which key?*\n\n*What do you believe is on the other side?*\n\n*That is what opens me.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":184,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}